dding-left: 25px; }\n  .footer {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 68px;\n    bottom: 34px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 24px;\n    color: #756e67;\n    font-size: 12px;\n  }\n  .page-number { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; }\n  @media (max-width: 760px) {\n    .page { transform-origin: top left; }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"page\">\n  <section class=\"sheet\">\n    <header class=\"title-bar\">习题 11.1</header>\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <h2>复习巩固</h2>\n\n      <p class=\"question q1-text\"><span class=\"num\">1.</span>图中有几个三角形？用符号表示这些三角形。</p>\n      <figure class=\"placeholder diagram-one\">\n        <figcaption>[Diagram: centered triangle with points A, B, C, D and E]</figcaption>\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 293 104\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"三角形ABC，D、E在BC上\">\n          <line x1=\"146\" y1=\"13\" x2=\"36\" y2=\"86\"></line>\n          <line x1=\"146\" y1=\"13\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"86\"></line>\n          <line x1=\"36\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"86\"></line>\n          <line x1=\"146\" y1=\"13\" x2=\"77\" y2=\"86\"></line>\n          <line x1=\"146\" y1=\"13\" x2=\"217\" y2=\"86\"></line>\n          <text x=\"142\" y=\"11\">A</text>\n          <text x=\"29\" y=\"99\">B</text>\n          <text x=\"71\" y=\"99\">D</text>\n          <text x=\"214\" y=\"99\">E</text>\n          <text x=\"258\" y=\"99\">C</text>\n        </svg>\n      </figure>\n      <div class=\"figure-label\">（第1题）</div>\n\n      <p class=\"question q2\"><span class=\"num\">2.</span>长为10、7、5、3的四根木条，选其中三根组成三角形，有几种选法？为什么？</p>\n      <p class=\"question q3\"><span class=\"num\">3.</span>对于下面每个三角形，过顶点A画出中线、角平分线和高。</p>\n\n      <div class=\"tri-row\">\n        <div class=\"tri-item\">\n          <figure class=\"placeholder small-tri\">\n            <figcaption>[Diagram: triangle, left]</figcaption>\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 125 91\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"三角形ABC\">\n              <polyline points=\"21,75 92,75 83,16 21,75\"></polyline>\n              <text x=\"14\" y=\"82\">B</text><text x=\"94\" y=\"82\">C</text><text x=\"80\" y=\"13\">A</text>\n            </svg>\n          </figure>\n          <div class=\"sub-label\">（1）</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"tri-item\">\n          <figure class=\"placeholder small-tri\">\n            <figcaption>[Diagram: right triangle, center]</figcaption>\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 125 91\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"直角三角形ABC\">\n              <polyline points=\"23,75 23,12 96,75 23,75\"></polyline>\n              <polyline points=\"23,67 31,67 31,75\"></polyline>\n              <text x=\"14\" y=\"82\">B</text><text x=\"98\" y=\"82\">C</text><text x=\"18\" y=\"10\">A</text>\n            </svg>\n          </figure>\n          <div class=\"sub-label\">（2）</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"tri-item\">\n          <figure class=\"placeholder small-tri\">\n            <figcaption>[Diagram: obtuse triangle, right]</figcaption>\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 125 91\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"三角形ABC\">\n              <polyline points=\"23,12 50,75 108,75 23,12\"></polyline>\n              <text x=\"17\" y=\"10\">A</text><text x=\"43\" y=\"83\">B</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"82\">C</text>\n            </svg>\n          </figure>\n          <div class=\"sub-label\">（3）</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"figure-label q3-label\">（第3题）</div>\n\n      <section class=\"q4\">\n        <p class=\"q4-head\"><span class=\"num\">4.</span>如图，在△ABC中，AE是中线，AD是角平分线，AF是高，填空：</p>\n        <div class=\"fill-list\">\n          <div>（1）$BE=$<span class=\"blank short\"></span>$=\\dfrac{1}{2}$<span class=\"blank\"></span>；</div>\n          <div>（2）$\\angle BAD=$<span class=\"blank\"></span>$=\\dfrac{1}{2}$<span class=\"blank\"></span>；</div>\n          <div>（3）$\\angle AFB=$<span class=\"blank\"></span>$=90^\\circ$；</div>\n          <div>（4）$S_{\\triangle ABC}=$<span class=\"blank long\"></span>。</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q4-figure-wrap\">\n          <figure class=\"placeholder diagram-four\">\n            <figcaption>[Diagram: triangle ABC with segments AE, AD and AF]</figcaption>\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 235 140\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"三角形ABC及中线、角平分线和高\">\n              <line x1=\"119\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"115\"></line>\n              <line x1=\"119\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"221\" y2=\"115\"></line>\n              <line x1=\"19\" y1=\"115\" x2=\"221\" y2=\"115\"></line>\n              <line x1=\"119\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"111\" y2=\"115\" style=\"stroke:#77a5b5;stroke-width:1.5\"></line>\n              <line x1=\"119\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"126\" y2=\"115\" style=\"stroke:#b66e73;stroke-width:1.5\"></line>\n              <line x1=\"119\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"115\"></line>\n              <polyline points=\"132,115 132,107 140,107\"></polyline>\n              <text x=\"115\" y=\"9\">A</text><text x=\"11\" y=\"128\">B</text><text x=\"220\" y=\"128\">C</text>\n              <text x=\"104\" y=\"128\">E</text><text x=\"122\" y=\"128\">D</text><text x=\"139\" y=\"128\">F</text>\n            </svg>\n          </figure>\n          <div class=\"figure-label q4-label\">（第4题）</div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"q5\">\n        <p class=\"question\"><span class=\"num\">5.</span>选择题。</p>\n        <p class=\"question\" style=\"padding-left:25px;\">下列图形中有稳定性的是（　）。</p>\n        <div class=\"choices\">\n          <div>（A）正方形</div><div>（B）长方形</div>\n          <div>（C）直角三角形</div><div>（D）平行四边形</div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"application\">\n        <div class=\"section-title\">综合运用</div>\n        <p class=\"question\"><span class=\"num\">6.</span>一个等腰三角形的一边长为6 cm，周长为20 cm，求其他两边的长。</p>\n        <p class=\"question\"><span class=\"num\">7.</span>（1）已知等腰三角形的一边长等于5，另一边长等于6，求它的周长；</p>\n        <p class=\"question subquestion\">（2）已知等腰三角形的一边长等于4，另一边长等于9，求它的周长。</p>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <footer class=\"footer\">\n    <span class=\"page